-- s 28: weeks are not defined (fork F6)
#ASSERT `On what day does the legislation come into force a number of units after my event` 2 `weeks` (Date 1 7 2020) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 28: years are not defined (fork F5)
#ASSERT `On what day does the legislation come into force a number of units after my event` 1 `years` (Date 1 7 2020) EQUALS NOTHING

