-- s 33(1)(c)
#ASSERT `Do my existing rights and proceedings survive the repeal or amendment` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- s 33(1): none of the three
#ASSERT `Do my existing rights and proceedings survive the repeal or amendment` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

§ `Am I still liable for an offence I committed before the law was repealed or amended`

-- s 34(1): committed before
