-- worked case 5 with s 55
#ASSERT `Until which day may I do the thing if my last day is not a working day` (Date 28 2 2026) (Date 6 2 2026) (Date 3 4 2026) (Date 6 4 2026) (Date 25 4 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 10 7 2026) (Date 26 10 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 2 3 2026)
-- worked case 6 with s 55: Thursday 29 February 2024 is a working day
#ASSERT `Until which day may I do the thing if my last day is not a working day` (Date 29 2 2024) (Date 6 2 2024) (Date 29 3 2024) (Date 1 4 2024) (Date 25 4 2024) (Date 3 6 2024) (Date 28 6 2024) (Date 28 10 2024) EQUALS JUST (Date 29 2 2024)
-- a working day: the same day
#ASSERT `Until which day may I do the thing if my last day is not a working day` (Date 5 2 2026) (Date 6 2 2026) (Date 3 4 2026) (Date 6 4 2026) (Date 25 4 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 10 7 2026) (Date 26 10 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 5 2 2026)
-- Waitangi Day, Friday 6 February 2026: Monday 9 February
#ASSERT `Until which day may I do the thing if my last day is not a working day` (Date 6 2 2026) (Date 6 2 2026) (Date 3 4 2026) (Date 6 4 2026) (Date 25 4 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 10 7 2026) (Date 26 10 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 9 2 2026)

